=== What I am unsure of

- wasm32-unknown-unknown gets sin, exp, ln and the rest from Rust's libm
  port, not from the glibc libm that CI uses. The two can differ in the last
  bits. At a 1e-10 gate that should not matter, and the clean run matches CI
  (0 failures), but the harness and CI are not the same binary.
- The generator discarded 137 draws as text-vs-tree mismatches (its own
